.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SCHEDULE SAVE"
.SH NAME
hamstik schedule save \- Save (or replace) a schedule definition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik schedule save [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save (or replace) a schedule definition
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I NAME
Schedule name (letters, digits, `-`, `_`; 1–64 chars)
.TP
.I COMMAND
The `hamstik` arguments to run, after `--`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --force
Replace an existing definition of the same name
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --description
Optional human description of the snapshot
